---
description: >-
  When generating Vertiege achievement, profession, badge, or world images, use the
  image manifest queue and vertiege-asset-generator skill with GenerateImage.
globs:
  - docs/assets/**
  - assets/generated/**
  - assets/staging/**
  - scripts/image_gen.py
  - scripts/sync_image_manifest.py
alwaysApply: false
---

Use skill **vertiege-asset-generator** (`/.cursor/skills/vertiege-asset-generator/SKILL.md`).

- Queue: `docs/assets/image-manifest.json` + `python3 scripts/image_gen.py next --json`
- One image per turn; category `ach-*` covers bulk achievements (not 590 unique files)
- Transparent PNG for badges; no text in pixels
